* - Notation
  - Label 
  - Definition

* - agriculture
  - Agriculture
  - Includes all farming activities, agriculture and livestock 

* - agriculture_landDrainage
  - Agriculture - land drainage
  - «to-be-provided»

* - agriculture_irrigation
  - Agriculture - irrigation
  - Water storage for irrigation.

* - energy_hydropower
  - Energy – hydropower
  - «to-be-provided»

* - energy_nonHydropower
  - Energy – non-hydropower
  - Including cooling activities for thermal and nuclear plants.

* - aquaculture
  - Fisheries and aquaculture
  - Commercial fishing, aquaculture and fish farms
    (excluding recreational or sports angling, 
    which is included in the category 'tourism' below).

* - culturalHeritageProtection
  - Cultural heritage protection 
  - Archaeological sites and patrimony

* - floodProtection
  - Flood protection
  - «to-be-provided»

* - forestry
  - Forestry
  - ««to-be-provided»

* - industry
  - Industry
  - Water storage for all kinds of industry not included under other categories.

* - natureProtection
  - Nature protection
  - Nature protected areas

* - tourism
  - Tourism and recreation
  - Includes bathing, leisure boating and sailing, sports fishing/angling.  
    It does not include the urban development linked to tourism (under category 'urban').

* - transport
  - Transport
  - Road and rail traffic; shipping, navigation and ports; aviation.

* - urban
  - Urban development
  - Includes urban development linked to household, non-manufacturing commercial activities, tourism. 

* - urban_publicWaterSupply
  - Urban development
  - Water storage for domestic public water supply (mostly drinking water supply).

* - unknown
  - Unknown
  - Unknown use. The selection of this option will trigger an ERROR.

* - other
  - Other
  - Other use not included in any of the categories above.

```

